有點白飯，但是今天的湯頭也偏鹹，用白飯也蓋不住他的鹹味，最後只能湯泡飯配著小菜吃一吃整體來說，其實我是想給一顆星的但是念在從小吃到大的情懷，我才勉強給兩顆星希望店家會看到這則評論並加以改善",null,[0,213]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/712854246284947376/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvTW1OWVZsTlJiWFJaV2tWT1UxTkVXa1ppVnpWVVZXMTBNMU5IWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,907,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMmNYVlNRbXRZWkVOU1NEWkZiVzVUVW10M1NHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x328b16d330136d73!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmh2cXVSQmtYZENSSDZFbW5TUmt3SGc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMmNYVlNRbXRZWkVOU1NEWkZiVzVUVW10M1NHYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMmNYVlNRbXRZWkVOU1NEWkZiVzVUVW10M1NHYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMmNYVlNRbXRZWkVOU1NEWkZiVzVUVW10M1NHYxILMGRmSU5mNnNYVzYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09taDJjWFZTUW10WVpFTlNTRFpGYlc1VFVtdDNTR2MSCzBkZklOZjZzWFc2IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARc20TMNMWizIqCzBkZklOZjZzWFc2\u0026wv\u003d1\u